{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706210/extras/ab5b7a78ed70c48055887c06b668bcb6.poster.avif?t=1761831323\" width=960 height=376 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706210/extras/ab5b7a78ed70c48055887c06b668bcb6.webm?t=1761831323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706210/extras/ab5b7a78ed70c48055887c06b668bcb6.mp4?t=1761831323\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FIGHT FOR SURVIVAL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Countless dangers await you and your survivors. Keep them fed, healthy, and protected from the cold. Even with enough food and medkits, stress, fatigue, and hunger can still break them.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HANDCRAFTED CHARACTERS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >People are not just stats. Each has a past, a personality, and relations towards each other. Every survivor has unique traits and moral values that influence the game. Some will not agree with your decisions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STRATEGIC BASE MANAGEMENT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assign survivors to key stations such as the workshop, generator, or life support. Repairs and upgrades keep the base running, but limited resources will force difficult choices. Every task matters, every mistake has consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706210/extras/ab29a782964ec72a5a86f5bbfbdd5a96.poster.avif?t=1761831323\" width=960 height=376 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706210/extras/ab29a782964ec72a5a86f5bbfbdd5a96.webm?t=1761831323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706210/extras/ab29a782964ec72a5a86f5bbfbdd5a96.mp4?t=1761831323\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPAND YOUR OUTPOST</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore and expand your outpost while defending it against monstrous creatures. Gather and refine resources, construct new buildings, and strengthen your defenses. Destroy nests and contain the spreading contamination before it consumes your outpost.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TACTICAL REALTIME COMBAT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every expedition brings real-time tactical combat. Position your robots, control aggro, and use abilities at the right moment. Choose the right loadouts and adapt to each enemy type.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706210/extras/a5e7cfc049b0107d5ddf675aa37102c6.poster.avif?t=1761831323\" width=960 height=376 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706210/extras/a5e7cfc049b0107d5ddf675aa37102c6.webm?t=1761831323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706210/extras/a5e7cfc049b0107d5ddf675aa37102c6.mp4?t=1761831323\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ROBOT MANAGEMENT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build, upgrade, and repair your combat units. Fast and mobile Strikers or heavy and durable Defenders: choose the right team for each mission. Individualize them with many abilities and subsystems.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PERMADEATH</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether human or robot, death is final. Learn to live with loss and make sacrifices to keep others alive.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3706210?t=1761831323","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3706210?t=1761831323","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706210/10b43a5efd1b475db526c8d2f676f77064e1d4e2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761831323","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706210/10b43a5efd1b475db526c8d2f676f77064e1d4e2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761831323","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706210/extras/ab5b7a78ed70c48055887c06b668bcb6.poster.avif?t=1761831323\" width=960 height=376 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706210/extras/ab5b7a78ed70c48055887c06b668bcb6.webm?t=1761831323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706210/extras/ab5b7a78ed70c48055887c06b668bcb6.mp4?t=1761831323\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FIGHT FOR SURVIVAL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Countless dangers await you and your survivors. Keep them fed, healthy, and protected from the cold. Even with enough food and medkits, stress, fatigue, and hunger can still break them.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HANDCRAFTED CHARACTERS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >People are not just stats. Each has a past, a personality, and relations towards each other. Every survivor has unique traits and moral values that influence the game. Some will not agree with your decisions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STRATEGIC BASE MANAGEMENT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assign survivors to key stations such as the workshop, generator, or life support. Repairs and upgrades keep the base running, but limited resources will force difficult choices. Every task matters, every mistake has consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706210/extras/ab29a782964ec72a5a86f5bbfbdd5a96.poster.avif?t=1761831323\" width=960 height=376 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706210/extras/ab29a782964ec72a5a86f5bbfbdd5a96.webm?t=1761831323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706210/extras/ab29a782964ec72a5a86f5bbfbdd5a96.mp4?t=1761831323\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPAND YOUR OUTPOST</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore and expand your outpost while defending it against monstrous creatures. Gather and refine resources, construct new buildings, and strengthen your defenses. Destroy nests and contain the spreading contamination before it consumes your outpost.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TACTICAL REALTIME COMBAT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every expedition brings real-time tactical combat. Position your robots, control aggro, and use abilities at the right moment. Choose the right loadouts and adapt to each enemy type.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706210/extras/a5e7cfc049b0107d5ddf675aa37102c6.poster.avif?t=1761831323\" width=960 height=376 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706210/extras/a5e7cfc049b0107d5ddf675aa37102c6.webm?t=1761831323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706210/extras/a5e7cfc049b0107d5ddf675aa37102c6.mp4?t=1761831323\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ROBOT MANAGEMENT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build, upgrade, and repair your combat units. Fast and mobile Strikers or heavy and durable Defenders: choose the right team for each mission. Individualize them with many abilities and subsystems.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PERMADEATH</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether human or robot, death is final. Learn to live with loss and make sacrifices to keep others alive.</p>","developers":["Stonewake Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706210/ee302c46d8b9c6b2cda7cf76a05fc005826174d4/header.jpg?t=1761831323","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3706210/1362087011/630d27f4bce78d249f02ec17d6e6beb73c9e0f92/1757538118/dash_av1.mpd?t=1757539741","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3706210/1362087011/630d27f4bce78d249f02ec17d6e6beb73c9e0f92/1757538118/dash_h264.mpd?t=1757539741","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3706210/1362087011/630d27f4bce78d249f02ec17d6e6beb73c9e0f92/1757538118/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1757539741","id":257159773,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257159773/movie480.mp4?t=1757539741","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257159773/movie_max.mp4?t=1757539741"},"name":"Trailer - Early Alpha","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257159773/2cd19e4177f38c78c27d59f833eb71e44fdf02a8/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1757539741","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic